sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant API as OrderController
    participant SC as Settlement<br/>Calculator
    participant ES as EscrowService
    participant SM as OrderStateMachine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor H as Helper
    H->>API: POST /orders/{id}/status {awaiting_confirmation}
    API->>SM: transition(order, awaiting_confirmation)
    SM->>DB: Cek foto bukti bila kategori mewajibkan, simpan helper_finished_at
    API-->>C: Notifikasi minta konfirmasi, batas 24 jam
    C->>API: POST /orders/{id}/confirm + X-Idempotency-Key
    API->>SC: completion(order)
    SC-->>API: helper_payout, platform_commission, client_refund
    Note over SC: assertBalanced: helper_release + komisi + refund = held_amount
    API->>ES: settle(order, result, key)
    ES->>DB: BEGIN, kunci dompet client dan helper
    ES->>DB: Kurangi held_balance client, tambah available_balance helper, INSERT release
    ES->>DB: Simpan platform_commission dan helper_payout di orders
    API->>SM: transition(order, completed)
    ES->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>C: 200 completed, form penilaian
    API-->>H: Notifikasi dana dilepas
